{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"偏导数的几何意义：三维曲面与切片截线","goals":["理解多元函数在曲面上存在无穷多个方向的变化率","理解偏导数∂z/∂x是在固定y=y₀平面截断曲面后的切线斜率","理解'把y视为常数'在几何上等价于在平行截面上观察一元曲线"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["从三维曲面整体视角引入多方向变化率直觉","通过截面切割将三维曲面问题转化为二维一元切线斜率问题","结合数值滑块互动，动态体验截面平移对切线与偏导数的影响"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":0,"min":-2,"max":2,"label":"截面位置 y₀","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.02}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-01-task-01","prompt":"拖动旋转三维视角，观察抛物面 z = x² + y² 在各个方向上的弯曲形状。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["按住鼠标左键或拖动屏幕可以旋转视角","从顶部俯视可以看到同心圆等高线"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！你已经直观感受到了三维曲面的空间形态。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"scene3d_view","node":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","controls":["orbit","zoom","preset","reset"]}],"completion":{"kind":"scene3d_view_target","node":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","match":"view_direction","yaw":0.7853981633974483,"pitch":0.5235987755982988,"zoom":1,"angular_tolerance":0.03269908169872415,"zoom_tolerance":0.1}},{"as":"section-02-task-01","prompt":"拖动滑块改变截面位置 y₀ 的值，观察截线抛物线的变化。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["将 y₀ 调整为 1.0","注意观察截面在 y 轴上的位置变化"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"很好！你成功移动了截面 y = y₀，截线随着 y₀ 的改变而平移。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":1,"tolerance":0.01}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-01","purpose":"建构三维曲面 z = x² + y² 的直觉，理解多元函数在曲面上点沿无穷多个方向均有变化率。","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"欢迎来到多元微积分的几何世界！请看这个开口朝上的旋转抛物面，它的函数方程是 z = x² + y²。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"抛物面 z = x² + y²","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 + y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 + y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"y","value":0,"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section.value","expression":"number_01"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 + y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"对于一元函数，自变量只能沿着一维数轴前后移动；但在三维曲面上，从任意一点出发，我们可以朝 360 度无死角的任意方向移动，因此曲面在一点处存在无限多个方向的变化率。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:1:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"旋转曲面观察不同方向的陡峭程度"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"为了准确研究这种复杂的变化，我们需要建立降维分析的思想：如何把无限多个方向的变化，拆解为我们熟悉的方向呢？","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:1:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"多元函数的变化率特点","items":["曲面上一点存在无限多个变化方向","需要通过降维截面锁定特定方向进行分析"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0-region"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-02","purpose":"引入垂直于 y 轴的截面 y = y₀，推导截线方程 z = x² + y₀² 并理解偏导数 ∂z/∂x = 2x 的几何实质。","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"我们在三维空间中看到抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方。在曲面上的任意一点，我们可以沿着无数个不同的方向移动，因此多元函数在一点处存在无限多个方向的变化率。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:2:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察抛物面曲面及曲面上不同方向的变化趋势"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"为了研究其中最基础的变化率，我们引入一个垂直于 y 轴的切片平面 y 等于 y0。当这个平面截割曲面时，就得到一条一元曲线。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:2:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察截面与曲面相交形成的截线曲线"}},{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:2:2:3","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 + y_0^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0-region"}}]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"现在你可以拖动滑块调整截面位置 y0 的值，观察切片平面及其在曲面上截出的抛物线是如何随着 y0 变化的。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:2:3:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":1,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-03","purpose":"通过调节截面位置 y₀ 观察空间截线与切线平移，进行互动操练并巩固“代数常数对应几何截面”的观点。","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"大家看，当我们拖动滑块改变 y₀ 的位置时，垂直于 y 轴的截面在空间中平移，曲面上的截线也随之平滑移动。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:3:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察截面 y = y₀ 平移对曲面截线的影响"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:3:1:2","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":1.5,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"extended"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"但请注意，无论截面平移到哪里，截面内部都是一条关于 x 的一元抛物线。对于任意给定的 x，其沿 x 轴方向的切线斜率始终由偏导数 ∂z/∂x = 2x 决定。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:3:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"因此，代数计算中“把 y 视为常数”，在几何上就完全等价于“只在垂直于 y 轴的特定平行截面上考察一元函数的切线斜率”。现在，请你自己调节截面位置，动手感受一下。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:action:3:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0","sequence":4,"result":{"summary":"本课程展示了三维曲面 z = x² + y² 上偏导数的几何意义。通过平面 y = y₀ 切割曲面，我们将多元变化率化简为固定截面上一元曲线的切线斜率 ∂z/∂x = 2x，深刻理解了“将 y 视作常数”的几何本质。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"]}}
